Package: archaeosdm
Type: Package
Title: Archaeological Isotope Isoscapes and Species Distribution Models
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("archaeo-sdm", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.org")
Description: R interface to the Python package 'archaeo_sdm'. Builds temporal
    isoscapes (collagen d13C/d15N, apatite d13C/d18O) from archaeological
    isotope databases, fits MaxEnt habitat suitability models with palaeoclimate
    layers, compares periods within the same sub-region, and validates models
    with spatial block cross-validation. Rasters are returned as 'terra' objects
    and tables as data frames.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: reticulate (>= 1.28), utils
Suggests: terra, ggplot2
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
